-- Projection geometry: Parameters defining the source-detector distances and angles (e.g., $DSO, DSD$, detector pixel size, and a list of $N$ angles) [S1, unofficial].
-- Volume dimensions: $D \times D \times D$ (cubic volume) [S1, unofficial].
